# The context is the repository root; the image needs server/ and client/ only. Runtime STATE (corpus, mounted
# Claude login, a stale UI build, local client binaries) lives on volumes/mounts or is built by a stage, never
# copied in. (claude-auth also becomes root-owned at runtime and breaks the build context.)
*
!server/
!client/
server/data/
server/claude-auth/
server/client-dist/
server/.venv/
server/ui/node_modules/
server/ui/dist/
server/e2e/
**/__pycache__
**/*.log
server/.env
